 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Emma found an obstacle course with only ten stages.",
   "tag": "[conversational]",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "audio": "build/ep26/local_lines/line_00.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "It looked easy.",
   "tag": "[casual]",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "audio": "build/ep26/local_lines/line_01.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "But every time she failed, the course changed.",
   "tag": "[mysterious]",
   "pause": 0.35,
   "audio": "build/ep26/local_lines/line_02.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "The first time, the platforms moved.",
   "tag": "[conversational]",
   "pause": 0.2,
   "audio": "build/ep26/local_lines/line_03.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "The second time, the walls disappeared.",
   "tag": "[conversational]",
   "pause": 0.2,
   "audio": "build/ep26/local_lines/line_04.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "By her tenth attempt, the entire course was floating in space.",
   "tag": "[in awe]",
   "pause": 0.6,
   "audio": "build/ep26/local_lines/line_05.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "Emma was about to quit.",
   "tag": "[tired]",
   "pause": 0.45,
   "audio": "build/ep26/local_lines/line_06.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "Then she noticed a message beneath the starting platform.",
   "tag": "[mysterious]",
   "pause": 0.25,
   "audio": "build/ep26/local_lines/line_07.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"THE LEVEL LEARNS FROM YOU.\"",
   "tag": "[slowly]",
   "pause": 0.55,
   "speak": "The level learns from you.",
   "voice": "system",
   "audio": "build/ep26/local_lines/line_08.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "She stopped running.",
   "tag": "[mysterious]",
   "pause": 0.2,
   "audio": "build/ep26/local_lines/line_09.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "Instead, she waited.",
   "tag": "[softly]",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "audio": "build/ep26/local_lines/line_10.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "The obstacles began moving on their own.",
   "tag": "[mysterious]",
   "pause": 0.25,
   "audio": "build/ep26/local_lines/line_11.wav",
   "local": {
    "src": "en_us_007"
   }
  },
  {
   "text": "Lasers spun.",
   "tag": "[tense]",
   "pause": 0.12,
   "audio": "build/ep26/local_lines/line_12.wav",
   "speak": "Lasers... spun."
  },
  {
   "text": "Platforms vanished.",
   "tag": "[tense]",
   "pause": 0.12,
   "audio": "build/ep26/local_lines/line_13.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "And the finish line kept getting farther away.",
   "tag": "[tense]",
   "pause": 0.6,
   "audio": "build/ep26/local_lines/line_14.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "Then Emma realized something.",
   "tag": "[mysterious]",
   "pause": 0.2,
   "audio": "build/ep26/local_lines/line_15.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "The course wasn't testing her jumping skills.",
   "tag": "[mysterious]",
   "pause": 0.15,
   "audio": "build/ep26/local_lines/line_16.wav",
   "local": {
    "src": "en_us_006"
   },
   "speak": "The course wasn't testing her jumping skills."
  },
  {
   "text": "It was predicting her decisions.",
   "tag": "[ominous]",
   "pause": 0.55,
   "audio": "build/ep26/local_lines/line_17.wav",
   "local": {
    "src": "en_us_010"
   },
   "speak": "It was predicting, her decisions."
  },
  {
   "text": "So she did something completely unexpected.",
   "tag": "[mysterious]",
   "pause": 0.25,
   "audio": "build/ep26/local_lines/line_18.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "She jumped backward.",
   "tag": "[urgent]",
   "pause": 0.45,
   "audio": "build/ep26/local_lines/line_19.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "The entire course froze.",
   "tag": "[mysterious]",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "audio": "build/ep26/local_lines/line_20.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "A message appeared.",
   "tag": "[mysterious]",
   "pause": 0.2,
   "audio": "build/ep26/local_lines/line_21.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"UNPREDICTABLE ACTION DETECTED.\"",
   "tag": "[slowly]",
   "pause": 0.6,
   "speak": "Unpredictable action detected.",
   "voice": "system",
   "audio": "build/ep26/local_lines/line_22.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "Suddenly, a hidden path appeared beneath her feet.",
   "tag": "[in awe]",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "audio": "build/ep26/local_lines/line_23.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "Emma followed it to a glowing door.",
   "tag": "[mysterious]",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "audio": "build/ep26/local_lines/line_24.wav",
   "local": {
    "src": "en_us_010"
   },
   "speak": "Emma followed it, to a glowing door."
  },
  {
   "text": "Inside was a room filled with thousands of screens.",
   "tag": "[in awe]",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "audio": "build/ep26/local_lines/line_25.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "Each one showed a different player trying to escape.",
   "tag": "[mysterious]",
   "pause": 0.45,
   "audio": "build/ep26/local_lines/line_26.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "Then the screens all turned toward her.",
   "tag": "[ominous]",
   "pause": 0.35,
   "audio": "build/ep26/local_lines/line_27.wav",
   "speak": "Then the screens all turned, toward her."
  },
  {
   "text": "\"NEW LEVEL DESIGNER SELECTED.\"",
   "tag": "[slowly]",
   "pause": 0.6,
   "speak": "New level designer selected.",
   "voice": "system",
   "audio": "build/ep26/local_lines/line_28.wav"
  }
 ],
